{"qid": "ich_bench_12", "question": "仅根据甘孜锅庄正文，概括其表演的领舞设置、男女唱跳配合方式和节奏变化。", "gold_answer": "男女各有一名能歌善舞的卓本，即领舞人。 男队唱跳时女队只跳不唱，女队唱跳时男队只跳不唱。 节奏由慢渐快，进入高潮后以快节奏结束。", "question_category": "summary", "gold_evidence": ["ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_17", "ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_19", "ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_20"], "gold_evidence_details": [{"document_id": "ihchina_002f0878b7c0", "chunk_id": "ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_17", "source_url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project/12938", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-04T09:51:32+08:00", "evidence_text": "男女各有一能歌善舞的“卓本”（领舞人）。", "source_field": "content", "start": 0, "end": 20, "transformation": "none"}, {"document_id": "ihchina_002f0878b7c0", "chunk_id": "ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_19", "source_url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project/12938", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-04T09:51:32+08:00", "evidence_text": "男队唱跳时，女队只跳不唱；女队唱跳时，男队只跳不唱。", "source_field": "content", "start": 0, "end": 26, "transformation": "none"}, {"document_id": "ihchina_002f0878b7c0", "chunk_id": "ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_20", "source_url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project/12938", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-04T09:51:32+08:00", "evidence_text": "舞时男女或联臂或不联臂而舞，节奏由慢渐快，进入高潮以快节奏结束。", "source_field": "content", "start": 0, "end": 32, "transformation": "none"}], "answer_points": [{"text": "男女各有一名能歌善舞的卓本，即领舞人。", "evidence_ids": ["ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_17"]}, {"text": "男队唱跳时女队只跳不唱，女队唱跳时男队只跳不唱。", "evidence_ids": ["ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_19"]}, {"text": "节奏由慢渐快，进入高潮后以快节奏结束。", "evidence_ids": ["ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_20"]}], "gold_relation_path": [], "evidence_alternatives": {"ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_17": ["ihchina_2b4d37aa2272_content_17", "ihchina_4525fe7ba801_content_17", "ihchina_f5851e6c6f74_content_17"], "ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_19": ["ihchina_2b4d37aa2272_content_19", "ihchina_4525fe7ba801_content_19", "ihchina_f5851e6c6f74_content_19"], "ihchina_002f0878b7c0_content_20": ["ihchina_2b4d37aa2272_content_20", "ihchina_4525fe7ba801_content_20", "ihch