{"qid": "ich_bench_13", "question": "仅根据乌珠穆沁长调正文，概括其过去、新中国成立后以及文中所述当下三个阶段的传承方式。", "gold_answer": "过去通过岁时节日、人生仪礼及日常生活自然习得。 新中国成立后通过舞台表演、课堂传授培养人才。 文中所述当下通过政府、学校、民间团体和个人举办传习、培训、比赛等活动传承。", "question_category": "summary", "gold_evidence": ["ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_8", "ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_9", "ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_10"], "gold_evidence_details": [{"document_id": "ihchina_009d43e2a146", "chunk_id": "ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_8", "source_url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project/23641", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-04T09:49:23+08:00", "evidence_text": "&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;以前，乌珠穆沁长调主要通过在岁时节日、人生仪礼以及日常生活中自然习得而代代相传。", "source_field": "content", "start": 0, "end": 60, "transformation": "none"}, {"document_id": "ihchina_009d43e2a146", "chunk_id": "ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_9", "source_url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project/23641", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-04T09:49:23+08:00", "evidence_text": "中华人民共和国成立后，在莫德格和昭那斯图等大师的带领下，乌珠穆沁长调通过舞台表演、课堂传授等方式，培养了众多的表演人才。", "source_field": "content", "start": 0, "end": 60, "transformation": "none"}, {"document_id": "ihchina_009d43e2a146", "chunk_id": "ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_10", "source_url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project/23641", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-04T09:49:23+08:00", "evidence_text": "当下，政府、学校、民间团体和个人举办的传习、培训、比赛等活动，为乌珠穆沁长调传承提供了新的形式。", "source_field": "content", "start": 0, "end": 48, "transformation": "none"}], "answer_points": [{"text": "过去通过岁时节日、人生仪礼及日常生活自然习得。", "evidence_ids": ["ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_8"]}, {"text": "新中国成立后通过舞台表演、课堂传授培养人才。", "evidence_ids": ["ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_9"]}, {"text": "文中所述当下通过政府、学校、民间团体和个人举办传习、培训、比赛等活动传承。", "evidence_ids": ["ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_10"]}], "gold_relation_path": [], "evidence_alternatives": {"ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_8": [], "ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_9": [], "ihchina_009d43e2a146_content_10": []}, "review_status": "pending_human_cross_review", "path_validation": "not_applicable", "notes": "范围为指定项目正文；正文含邻近句指代时结合完整文档理解。字段类别/批次不作为答案依据。"}
{"qid": "ich_bench_14", "question": "仅根据爬山调正文，从移民带来的民歌交流、唱词特点和旋律结构三个方面概括其艺术形成与表现。", "gold_answer": "移民带来的民歌长期交流，融合河北、山西、陕西、山东等地特点，并吸收蒙古、回、满等民族音乐元素。 唱词短小精悍，多用乡土方言重叠词，字数无定、虚实相间。 多采用两乐句的乐段结构，下句多是上句的变化重复。", "question_category": "summary", "gold_evidence": ["ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_5", "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_8", "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_9"], "gold_evidence_details": [{"document_id": "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a", "chunk_id": "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_5", "source_url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project/12621", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-04T09:50:04+08:00", "evidence_text": "移民们将各自家乡的民歌带到内蒙，通过长期的交流碰撞，最终形成了融合河北、山西、陕西、山东等地民歌特点，吸收蒙古、回、满等民族音乐元素的爬山调。", "source_field": "content", "start": 0, "end": 71, "transformation": "none"}, {"document_id": "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a", "chunk_id": "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_8", "source_url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project/12621", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-04T09:50:04+08:00", "evidence_text": "&lt;br /&gt;\r\n　　爬山调唱词短小精悍，多用乡土方言重叠词，字数无定，虚实相间。", "source_field": "content", "start": 0, "end": 46, "transformation": "none"}, {"document_id": "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a", "chunk_id": "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_9", "source_url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project/12621", "retrieved_at": "2026-09-04T09:50:04+08:00", "evidence_text": "音乐以徵调式、商调式和宫调式居多，大都采用两乐句的乐段结构，下句多是上句的变化重复。", "source_field": "content", "start": 0, "end": 42, "transformation": "none"}], "answer_points": [{"text": "移民带来的民歌长期交流，融合河北、山西、陕西、山东等地特点，并吸收蒙古、回、满等民族音乐元素。", "evidence_ids": ["ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_5"]}, {"text": "唱词短小精悍，多用乡土方言重叠词，字数无定、虚实相间。", "evidence_ids": ["ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_8"]}, {"text": "多采用两乐句的乐段结构，下句多是上句的变化重复。", "evidence_ids": ["ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_9"]}], "gold_relation_path": [], "evidence_alternatives": {"ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_5": ["ihchina_6f530ece498e_content_5"], "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_8": ["ihchina_6f530ece498e_content_8"], "ihchina_00a45c44cc2a_content_9": ["ihchina_6f530ece498e_content_9"]}, "review_status": "pending_hum